fixture hazard_respawn_stays_off_the_lip
doc walking right off the chasm's edge (480 u) into the spikes, holding right throughout. Safe ground needs the same flat floor under the whole collider and 16 u beyond it each side, so the respawn is never on the ledge's lip: it used to creep to x 489 u (the collider overhanging the edge by 19 u), and the stick still held walked straight back off on the next tick, a respawn-and-fall loop every 23 frames (task 3 review 3, M3).
room test/chasm
spawn 300 384
frames 200
input
  0..199 R
end
expect
  mark die1 0..199 event.hazard=1
  at die1 ground=1 x<=454u
  never die1..die1+2 state=air
  mark die2 die1+1..199 event.hazard=1
  at die2 ground=1 x<=454u
end
